    "text": "countryherald.com\nwebsite\nMedford\nSouthern Oregon Weather: Dangerous Heat Builds By Thursday, Highs Near 102°F Next Week\nBy County Herald Weather Center,\n17 hours agoMedford, OR – Dangerous heat is set to intensify across Southern Oregon by Thursday, with Medford expected to hit 95°F by Friday and soar into the triple digits by early next week. The National Weather Service warns of a prolonged heatwave building across Jackson County, peaking Tuesday with a high near 102°F.\n4",
